{"synopsis":"Setelah enam bulan melarikan diri, vampir bernama Eugene akhirnya tewas.\n\nDijadikan korban persembahan untuk meningkatkan ketenaran seorang ksatria suci.\n\nTepat ketika hidupnya berakhir dalam penyesalan pahit, kesempatan untuk kembali datang padanya.\n\n“Aku tidak akan mati seperti itu lagi. Jika aku benar-benar telah kembali ke masa lalu, maka aku tidak akan menyesal untuk kedua kalinya… apa pun yang harus kulakukan.”","alternative_title":"Crimson Reset, 뱀파이어 로드로 사는 법","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Redice Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"62180925-26d4-433a-be4d-642367683301","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"34d01bc8-59b5-4875-88a8-9d7719ca834e","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2026-07-24","released":"2026-07-24"},{"chapter_id":"9321e852-93e7-4ce9-957a-ac2788f26135","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"624376a5-54b2-4673-8a7d-b227e9cb2cf1","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2026-07-11","released":"2026-07-11"},{"chapter_id":"24307130-04f7-44fa-a53f-9c14c529eacc","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2026-07-03","released":"2026-07-03"},{"chapter_id":"2e9b694d-dc30-4bf6-b92b-0742826d4fbe","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2026-06-26","released":"2026-06-26"},{"chapter_id":"549396c1-c718-471a-92de-48d60609e3dc","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2026-06-19","released":"2026-06-19"},{"chapter_id":"48d27223-547c-48ab-96d2-532017fa91ff","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2026-06-12","released":"2026-06-12"},{"chapter_id":"0f214e40-259b-4db2-85f3-fef2312e751e","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2026-06-05","released":"2026-06-05"},{"chapter_id":"7da0182b-a1de-4969-b840-fc3d54bbb48b","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2026-05-29","released":"2026-05-29"},{"chapter_id":"bbe482b4-d776-419f-8019-4786fcd4b8a6","number":"44","cha